// Les Trois Clefs d'Aiguemorne · act III, the coup (1/3): the entries for tonight's plans (A3m_coup, A3o_coup, A3v_coup
// branch on `plan_a3`), and the plan from below (dessous), led by the hand, at the midnight relay of the Great Vigil.
// Two beats around A3c_signal_dessous. First beat: monde:a3:c_main (in the stone box, unheard), monde:a3:c_oeil
// (Sans-Bruit kept off the Clos door), monde:a3:c_voix (something ready to draw the eyes), monde:a3:c_bruit.
// Result: monde:a3:clef=echangee|prise. Also monde:a3:douce_fausse (she ran off with the forgery), monde:a3:
// douce_livree (the eye rang the Swiss down on her), monde:a3:v_vue (the Dean looked at the mourner).
// Everything ends at A3c_apres (a3_suite).
